.SH NAME
TimeEvent.view \- TimeEvent: view property
.SH SYNOPSIS
The \f[B]\f[CB]TimeEvent.view\f[B]\f[R] read\-only property identifies
the WindowProxy from which the event was generated.
.SH VALUE
A WindowProxy object identifying the window that generated the event, or
\f[CR]null\f[R] if no window is associated.
